    "note": "The t/d row has no ti, tu, di or du cell — ち, つ, ぢ, づ sit there instead. Loanwords rebuild the missing sounds with テ, デ, ト, ド plus a small vowel. Note the IME keys: thi, dhi, twu, dwu.",
